{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 9, :comments ["<b>הרחקת</b>, <b>תועבות</b> — defective [spelling], lacking a <b>kaf</b> [of the plural suffix]." "<b>כלוא</b> — from the illness. And the meaning: for his acquaintances have distanced themselves and do not visit him, and he appears <b>confined</b> [כלוא] and cannot go to them."], :book :psalms, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 88, :notes {0 "Ibn Ezra flags that these forms are written without the expected plural ending; the reference is to defective orthography."}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Psalms -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/tehilim"] ["Wikisource Mikraot Gedolot" "http://en.wikisource.org/wiki/Mikraot_Gedolot/"] ["Tanakh, Venice, 1617-1619" "https://dlib.rsl.ru/viewer/01007514045#?page=4"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:36:20.559126534Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}